# The inputs of the mainline RC-10 install images of uc-pxx-installer (KIND=release):
# image/build.sh --install --board both --inputs THIS-FILE, from INSTALLER_COMMIT (mainline-rc-10: R23; the gate
# has no normal payload, step2set the R23 base 0.2.0-rc10-base of uc-pxx-linux r23-base 2d34eed (built twice
# byte-identical from snap11 in the two-stage order); the A/B tool uc-pxx-bootctl-inst r3 639b6514 (uc-pxx-linux
# bootctl-r3 de744a5); the step-1 USB service uc-pxx-xfer (built by image/build.sh, 62421c48); I-1, I-2, I-4, I-5,
# I-6, I-7). The build stops if a value differs. New tokens (used by no other inputs file). The images are for no
# unit until the release review names their sha256 (the tokens pxx-inst-410f82 / pxx-inst-408d79 of the first
# RC-10 build, c22ff34, are superseded: never used) and the safety rules name the image and the unit.
